Get-ExecutionPolicy

Displays the current PowerShell script execution policy.

Useful for: Understanding script security restrictions  Troubleshooting script execution issues  Preparing systems for automation

Policies include Restricted, RemoteSigned, and Unrestricted

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Set-ExecutionPolicy

Changes PowerShell’s script execution policy.

Useful for: Enabling script execution  Running administrative automation  Developing PowerShell scripts

Set-ExecutionPolicy <PolicyName>

Set-ExecutionPolicy RemoteSigned


